# Semgrep's built-in ignore list drops test directories. In this repository the
# code under test lives in test/fixtures/kassandra-sast-demo — the fixture *is*
# the subject of the E2E contract — so that default silences every file the
# contract asserts on, and `make test-e2e` fails with 21 "no finding was
# reported there" messages.
#
# Providing this file replaces Semgrep's default list, so it re-states only what
# genuinely should not be scanned. Keep it aligned with `exclude:` in
# .cortex.yaml.

node_modules/
vendor/
.venv/
venv/
site-packages/
dist/
build/
target/
__pycache__/
*.min.js
*.min.css

# Cortex's own scan artifacts
bench/
results/
.cortex/
